+Please modularize the monolithic legal engine into a robust, decoupled multi-agent architecture across `/opt/roxira_platform/output_apps/generated_modules/smartjudge/`:
+
+1. Create `security/pii_scrubber.py`:
+   - Implement `mask_pii_entities(text: str) -> Tuple[str, Dict[str, str]]` masking 10-digit National IDs (`[کدملی_X]`), Iranian mobile numbers 09xx (`[شماره_همراه_X]`), bank IBANs/Cards, and party aliases (`[خواهان_X]`, `[خوانده_X]`).
+   - Implement `unmask_pii_entities(text: str, mapping: Dict[str, str]) -> str`.
+
+2. Create `agents/supervisor.py`:
+   - Fast intent classifier parsing queries into `RESEARCH_QA`, `FORMAL_DISPUTE`, `PLAYBOOK_REVIEW`, `RETRIAL_PETITION`.
+   - Strips conversational boilerplate phrases and normalizes queries.
+
+3. Create `agents/researcher.py`:
+   - Handles Dual-Level LightRAG retrieval querying PostgreSQL recursive graph CTE and Qdrant collections (`iran_laws_bge_m3`, `judicial_precedents`).
+   - Drops irrelevant fallback procedural articles scoring below threshold.
+
+4. Create `agents/drafter.py`:
+   - Generates structured legal advisories and formal litigation drafts using OpenRouter models with adaptive thinking.
+   - For `RESEARCH_QA`: outputs concise bulleted summaries and returns empty strings for draft_text and jurisdiction.
+   - For `FORMAL_DISPUTE`: generates full legal petitions and evaluates competent jurisdiction.
+
+5. Create `agents/playbook_reviewer.py`:
+   - Implements parallel clause audit for contracts (force majeure, dispute resolution, limitation of liability, penalty clauses).
+
+6. Create `agents/verifier.py`:
+   - Validates cited law articles against known repealed/modified statutes in PostgreSQL graph.
+
+7. Refactor `smartjudge_module.py`:
+   - Keep all existing FastAPI routes (`/analyze-case`, `/retrial-evaluate`, `/health`, STT audio endpoints) intact.
+   - Import and orchestrate the sub-agents cleanly inside the route handlers.
+

